<title>INDONESIA: Prasidha sees 1997 net at 40 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Prasidha sees 1997 net at 40 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>SURABAYA, Indonesia 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian trading firm PT Prasidha Aneka Niaga expects to record net profits of 40 billion rupiah in 1997, vice-president director Jeffry Soedargo said on Monday.</p>
<p>He was speaking to reporters after the company announced that its 1996 net profits were 30.7 billion rupiah on sales of 740.8 billion rupiah.</p>
<p>Soedargo gave no further details.</p>
</text>
